; expect-fail: legacy — division by zero errors on the interpreter but
; evaluates to () on the EIR VM; the backends disagree on the error class.
; expect-fail: wasm — i64.div_s traps on zero, which surfaces as a wasmtime
; trap, not the VM's silent () nor the interpreter's runtime error.
[fn main []
  [println [/ 1 0]]]
